description:
Trump promises to jail political opponents, fire civil servants acting in the public interest and hire lackeys to run the government.

Project 2025's Schedule F—which he tried to implement in 2020—is the crux of his plan.

@StaceyPlaskett @RepJasmine @Accountable_Us &amp; I explain👇

Contrary to Joe Biden’s comments, Americans who support an America First agenda are not GARBAGE.

Even worse is the White House trying to cover up Biden’s statement.

@RepJamesComer and I are demanding the Biden-Harris Administration retain documents and internal communications

